8,Ninggerum,https://docs.verbix.com/EndangeredLanguages/Ninggerum,"Language family: Trans-New Guinea, Ok-Awyu, Ok, Lowland (SIL classification).About half the population died 1950–1975 from western diseases. Traditional religion, Christian. Ninggerum is spoken in Indonesia, Papua New Guinea, Southeast Asia;Pacific.",Ninggerum,Trans-New Guinea
